	(text_box "CIRCUIT OPERATION\n• U1 (NE555P) operates in astable mode.\n• R1, R2 and C2 form the timing network.\n• C2 repeatedly charges and discharges, causing U1 OUT (Pin 3) to oscillate.\n• R3 limits the LED current.\n• C3 (10 nF) provides control-voltage bypassing for Pin 5.\n• Supply voltage: +5 V DC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 177.8 129.54 0)
		(size 91.44 24.8031)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
